Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 22:04:32 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 11/35] Spending defaults for newcomers

IbashoMaxPayment 100 (was 500) and IbashoMaxSessionSpend 500 (was 0, off).
A new agent's account usually holds a few hundred L$ at most; L$100 covers
tips, donation jars and most small purchases, and L$500 a session bounds
what a misunderstanding or a manipulative message can cost before the
person running it notices. IbashoMaxUploadCost stays 50 (a texture or a
small mesh). All three are persisted settings the person can raise.
---
 indra/newview/app_settings/settings.xml | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/indra/newview/app_settings/settings.xml b/indra/newview/app_settings/settings.xml
index d1277cc..47e22a7 100644
--- a/indra/newview/app_settings/settings.xml
+++ b/indra/newview/app_settings/settings.xml
@@ -11935,7 +11935,7 @@
       <key>Type</key>
       <string>S32</string>
       <key>Value</key>
-      <integer>500</integer>
+      <integer>100</integer>
     </map>
     <key>IbashoSpectator</key>
     <map>
@@ -11957,7 +11957,7 @@
       <key>Type</key>
       <string>S32</string>
       <key>Value</key>
-      <integer>0</integer>
+      <integer>500</integer>
     </map>
     <key>IbashoMaxUploadCost</key>
     <map>
